'''Horrorpotamus''' (デッカーバチャン ''Dekkābachan Kyōshū'', '''Dekkābachan's Assault!''') was an event added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Horrorpotamus would reset when the event ended, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returned. The boss of this Gauntlet was [[Super Hyppoh]], a variant of [[Hyppoh]] with a lot more knockbacks, long-reaching Omni Strikes, and a 100% chance to slow Cat Units. As of [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], this event was replaced with the [[Horrorpotamus|new version]] with 20 levels.

==Overview==
===About===
Horrorpotamus contained a total of 60 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Cosmic Juggernaut Lvs.''', spread across 3 different maps: '''Horrorpotamus!''' (Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.1~20), '''Horrorpotamus!!''' (Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.21~40) and '''Horrorpotamus!!!''' (Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.41~60). After beating a Cosmic Juggernaut Lv., the player had to wait for 30 minutes before they could proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of an Cosmic Juggernaut Lv. could include [[Battle Items]], [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. Every 20 Cosmic Juggernaut Lvs. played out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP were increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Horrorpotamus (Old)/Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.1~20]], [[Horrorpotamus (Old)/Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.21~40]] and [[Horrorpotamus (Old)/Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.41~60]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Horrorpotamus! was unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.
*Horrorpotamus!! was unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 and appeared 2 days into the event.
*Horrorpotamus!!! was unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1 and appeared 4 days into the event.

